0..72 Comment "// A task answering its parent\'s request cannot reply before the request"
73..84 Comment "// arrives."
85..87 Comment "//"
88..163 Comment "// The parent\'s send, the task\'s receipt and the task\'s reply form a chain."
164..241 Comment "// The channel\'s web opens on a series of those three events. Only the task\'s"
242..294 Comment "// close commutes with the parent reading the reply."
295..297 Comment "//"
298..371 Comment "// The parent forks the task, sends it a request and reads the reply. The"
372..432 Comment "// trace states the web the run plays on the task\'s channel."
433..435 Comment "//"
436..515 Comment "// - see: `independent.gandr` — two tasks whose plays do not order each other"
516..593 Comment "// - see: #3338 — the run\'s trace and the web a source states for a channel"
595..619 Comment "// The task\'s protocols."
